cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or benchmark in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "URP: A Unified Algorithm Library and Benchmark for Agricultural Robot Path Planning"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Peng"
    given-names: ""
    # TODO: 补全作者全名、单位与 ORCID
code-repository: "https://github.com/peakpeng666/URP"
license: "TODO-confirm-license"  # 仓库暂无 LICENSE 文件，发布基准包前需确认
abstract: >
  URP is a research system for agricultural robot path planning,
  providing a unified algorithm library (28 registered configurations
  across five problem classes: point-to-point, Euclidean CVRP,
  turning-aware routing, coverage, and fleet planning), a frozen
  benchmark of 4,505 independently verified runs, and instance-level
  algorithm selection studies with explicit negative results.
keywords:
  - agricultural robotics
  - path planning
  - capacitated vehicle routing
  - algorithm selection
  - benchmark
  - coverage path planning
